*.js
!jest.config.js
*.d.ts
node_modules

# CDK asset staging directory
.cdk.staging
cdk.out

# CDK's own auto-written context cache (fix round 1, SHOULD 4). The CLI writes to this file whenever a
# context provider runs, and the keys it writes (e.g. `availability-zones:account=<12 digits>`) embed the
# account id. Hand-authored config belongs in cdk.json's own `context` block instead, which the CDK CLI
# never auto-writes to.
cdk.context.json

# The built Lambda artifact (design.md D30, infra/scripts/build-lambda.sh).
# Rebuilt from `uv export`/`src/rain_alert`, never committed.
build/

# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It pins the tree that runs
# with CloudFormation deploy credentials, and an unpinned tree is re-resolved
# on every machine. It carries one third-party email address — npm's copy of
# glob@10.5.0's published deprecation notice — which the secret scan forgives
# by exact string in tests/hygiene/test_repo_hygiene.py.
